h it, laughing all the way.</div> </div> </div> </div>in an acct of blatant and terrible disregard for all things good and pure in this world I wantonly created the hate thread. I don't want to be behind all the big threads so I'm hoping someone else will take over making one or two of the others. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T10:24:17-08:00","id":3597,"title":"","content":"I like that these forums are far more intuitive and responsive than the old ones and that they make me want to post more often.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thinking as I do that the Creator of this World is a very Cruel Being &amp; being a Worshipper of Christ, I cannot help saying: &quot;the Son, O how unlike the Father!&quot; First God Almighty comes with a Thump on the Head. Then Jesus Christ comes with a balm to heal it. - William Blake, Christian mystic and visionary","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/774-pilgrim","name":"Pilgrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar774_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T04:27:59-08:00","id":4208,"title":"","content":"I can haz Game thread?<br /> <br /> ....let me try that again...<br /> <br /> Is there any already made-out plan of who could/should make what threads?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T05:10:14-08:00","id":4217,"title":"","content":"I've been holding off on most while I wait for Rose Bailey to answer my question about what a Mega Thread is. That said, I've rationalized my decision to give up on waiting pretty effectively, so if you don't want to risk moderator wrath, I'd be happy to create a whole slew of Let's Talks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T05:20:29-08:00","id":4221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=4217#post4217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been holding off on most while I wait for Rose Bailey to answer my question about what a Mega Thread is. That said, I've rationalized my decision to give up on waiting pretty effectively, so if you don't want to risk moderator wrath, I'd be happy to create a whole slew of Let's Talks.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not even sure how a &quot;mega thread&quot; keeps people from wanting to join in on the conversation... On most forums, I look for the mega threads to post in first since it's one of those long-standing threads that just...exist and may still be used for quite some time.... The threads like &quot;What Time Is It Now?&quot; and such we just some of the best ways I found to get in on what's happening and be able to look back in that very same thread to know how long it's been around, who all still posts from that time, and who doesn't... <br /> <br /> I'm just strange, I guess. Don't mind me. I guess y'all will decide how to handle the thread-making here so I'll just wait for whatever I feel like I want to say something in to pop up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T09:48:41-08:00","id":4425,"title":"","content":"I hereby claim this land in the name of Aerten!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=245#post245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, a request: could we stay away from Mega Threads in this new incarnation of the forums? I'm not hard ruling against them, but they tend to be difficult to moderate and intimidating for new users.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can also think of a few I wouldn't want around for more specific reasons...<br /> <br /> My thought is, rather than nebuolous threads to encompass the entire topic of Religion or Politics, make specific threads about individual topics as they come up.<br /> <br /> It would also help make discussion within those threads more focused and easier.<br /> <br /> Heck, we already did that with news and science threads, just spread it out a bit.<br /> <br /> And I think image sharing of certain types should be primarily left to private messages between people who you know are into that stuff.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T10:09:29-08:00","id":4437,"title":"","content":"A specific thread about a political issue might be best.<br /> <br /> Say for example, a person's experience with the new Healthcare law the Affordable Care Act.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T10:18:25-08:00","id":4446,"title":"","content":"Maybe they also want to cut-down on closing whole threads because they went off into one disagreeable tangent.<br /> <br /> How many times have the politics and religion threads been shut down because two people got into the bi-polar arguments?<br /> <br /> More specific threads could mean certain ones can go on while others get shut down quick.....as they should be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T11:09:40-08:00","id":4470,"title":"","content":"I'm with a few here. I find it more intimidating if I find 50 threads with the same topic then one big one. I know where to start when there is just one big one. &quot;Should I post in this one? Well there is another so maybe that is an old one? Or maybe this is a click thing? If I post well this post is from a few days ago so maybe this is the old one?&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T14:30:05-08:00","id":4595,"title":"","content":"Jeez, guys, I don't think they want us to make &quot;What I love&quot; threads every fifty posts.<br /> <br /> I mean, we have that thread that we can post little tidbits to, and if we have something specific that happened to us we can start a thread <i>about</i> that thing.<br /> <br /> How many times did the Love and Hate threads go off for twenty posts talking about one specific thing somebody said?<br /> <br /> Just picture spinning those off into separate threads.<br /> <br /> Heck, maybe imagine threads about <i>different things</i> to love.<br /> <br /> If it's hard to figure out what thread to take part in, the original poster chose a shit title for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T22:25:50-08:00","id":4863,"title":"","content":"I believe the idea is to keep the generic stuff to a minimum and allow us to kill one problem discussion without shutting off all the others.<br /> <br /> Lets say, for example, that someone takes offense at a comment in the Hate thread causing a small flamewar. In the interim, someone else decides to begin discussing how they dislike the proliferation of mayonnaise in modern sandwiches. Killing the thread means mayo guy's side discussion dies.<br /> <br /> That being said, think twice before starting a thread on how much you hate mayo. If it feels weird making a new thread, the discussion might have been pointless in the first place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b> Onyx Path Forum Moderator</b></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Read the rules</a><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">This is my mod voice.</span></b><br /> This is not my mod voice.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9-sparketh","name":"Sparketh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T01:35:57-08:00","id":4900,"title":"","content":"I've also found at times that those extended generic threads could be kind of off-putting in that, if you left them for a while and came back and some extended subtopic had become vogue within it, it could be pretty difficult to know where it started, and you'd have to trawl back through pages to figure it out.<br /> <br /> That also means you never really knew what was going to be on discussion for the latest page of, say, Film or TV threads, and you'd often have good odds of trying to add a topic that would get ignored and pushed aside in favor of bigger lines of discussion. That's certainly the reason I never really contributed to those threads.<br /> <br /> Really, mega threads are like six or seven threads masquerading as one, either taking place simultaneously or artlessly grafted onto the end of one another.<br /> <br /> They're the Yozi Charms of threads.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T02:41:36-08:00","id":4925,"title":"","content":"I'd say the Mega Threads (tm) are chatrooms pretending to be threads. And I agree that, perhaps, that is not the best practice.<br /> <br /> I feel like we (I) need a place to dump an idle thought and allow possible banter to evolve from that. It helps, at its best, to create a caf\u00e9-like atmosphere (and at its worst something very terrible) where people can come and go to hang out as they please, and helps build community and forge relationships. Sure, it often also turned pretty sour, but I don't think that's an issue with the format. I also realize that the massive 87-page threads can be absolutely daunting to pore over, especially if you've been away for a week or two, or are completely new. I know I didn't even *look* at the threads in General Discussion when I first started posting on the WW forums, simply because the vastness of the most popular threads was intimidating, and there seemed to be an established crowd of people that did the bantering. I ended up overcoming this intimidation, and I'm glad I did, and I'm glad there was an established medium (in this case in the form of Mega Threads (tm) ) for me to do so.<br /> <br /> It often isn't evident until after the fact whether a thought, gripe or declaration of love was worthy of its own thread, and therefore I feel like &quot;well, look at the Hate/Love/Let's Talk thread, it contained several individual threads within it!&quot; is a.. technically true but not entirely useful statement in this context. We need a place for idle chatter.<br /> <br /> ...I also feel like this maybe should be an actual chatroom* rather than a Mega Thread (tm).<br /> <br /> *= say, IRC -- an attempt was made a while back to make a WW forum IRC room, I believe it was cearealkiller who was the mastermind behind that. But it didn't really take","signature":"","edited":{"userid":508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","user":"sikker","date":". 11-07-2013, 05:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T06:10:09-08:00","id":5012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sikker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=4925#post4925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also realize that the massive 87-page threads can be absolutely daunting to pore over, especially if you've been away for a week or two, or are completely new.</div> </div> </div> </div>I Liked your post because it's been years since I've seen anyone spell &quot;pore&quot; correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T08:42:18-08:00","id":5097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sikker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=4925#post4925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">an attempt was made a while back to make a WW forum IRC room, I believe it was cearealkiller who was the mastermind behind that. But it didn't really take</div> </div> </div> </div>Ummm, you mean like the Exalted/WW IRC channel I've been on almost every day for the last year?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T10:04:13-08:00","id":5182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=5097#post5097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ummm, you mean like the Exalted/WW IRC channel I've been on almost every day for the last year?</div> </div> </div> </div>nah I had attempted to make one on Rizon. the most people I ever had in the room was myself, Sikker and Lox. The Exalted one is find and dandy but the one problem we run into with something like that is topic and volume of people. Its specialized for Exalted for the Exalted community. I was trying to do one for just the rest of the forums.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":372,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","user":"cerealkiller","date":". 11-07-2013, 01:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T17:21:59-08:00","id":5597,"title":"","content":"Just out of curiosity, why is Changeling:the Dreaming left out? Sure, I plan to get V20 later on but I love the old stuff. I remember reading C:tD* to my daughter and I am sure that there are others who would like to see it added to the classic forum.<br /> <br /> *I also read all revised clanbooks to her since we had worn out &quot;Good Night Moon&quot; before she was 3. Now I got a roleplaying coplayer college student studying music.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T18:15:34-08:00","id":5636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JadedTrueBrujah</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=5597#post5597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just out of curiosity, why is Changeling:the Dreaming left out? Sure, I plan to get V20 later on but I love the old stuff. I remember reading C:tD* to my daughter and I am sure that there are others who would like to see it added to the classic forum.<br /> <br /> *I also read all revised clanbooks to her since we had worn out &quot;Good Night Moon&quot; before she was 3. Now I got a roleplaying coplayer college student studying music.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you mean why didn't C:tD (or anything other than the Big 3) get a subforum to themselves, I'll let Rose Bailey answer your question:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Currently, cWoD games other than <i>Vampire</i>, <i>Werewolf</i>, and <i>Mage</i> should go in the main cWoD forum. The others don't generate enough traffic to justify their own forums... yet. Let's see what happens with anniversary editions.<br /> <br /> Before you ask, I'd rather not have as many nWoD subforums as we do either, but we didn't want to be eliminating any forum choices that were offered at CCP. We got rid of board and card games, but that's because we don't have anything to do with those anymore.</div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=5182#post5182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> nah I had attempted to make one on Rizon. the most people I ever had in the room was myself, Sikker and Lox. The Exalted one is find and dandy but the one problem we run into with something like that is topic and volume of people. Its specialized for Exalted for the Exalted community. I was trying to do one for just the rest of the forums.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hm. Might be a decent idea to look into trying that again. Sorcery.net's pretty accomodating of the Exalted crew, maybe we can set a white wolf one there as well. I know there'd be at least some crossover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T02:00:00-08:00","id":5774,"title":"","content":"Following up: how -does- an IRC channel on Sorcery.net sound to folks? I'm considering registering #opp or something like that. Any thoughts, considerations, or suggestions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T07:34:39-08:00","id":5897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kirby Jerusalem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/234-welcome-to-the-jungle?p=5774#post5774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Following up: how -does- an IRC channel on Sorcery.net sound to folks? I'm considering registering #opp or something like that. Any thoughts, considerations, or suggestions?</div> </div> </div> </div>As long as it doesn't boot me out for inactivity, I'm all for it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Seriously, that shit's starting to piss me off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","ava